cstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/test_det_measurement_provenance_heldout.py:1-8` — Preserve the measurement-provenance regression boundary. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_detached_child_cwd.py:1-19, 111-116` — Preserve detached-child working-directory independence. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_divergence_grade_split.py:1-16, 145-149` — Preserve the distinction between divergence grades. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_doctor_dirty_tree.py:1-22` — Preserve doctor diagnostics for a dirty ticket-store tree. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_doctor_mapping.py:1-19, 543-561` — Preserve doctor issue-to-remediation mapping and output contract. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_doctor_mcp_client.py:1-19` — Preserve MCP-client doctor checks and actionable diagnostics. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_engine_dir.py:152-176` — Preserve engine-directory resolution and isolation invariants. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_enrich_drain.py:61-66, 189-205, 472-480, 714-719, 1048-1059, 1177-1182` — Preserve drain ordering, retry, failure, and concurrency invariants. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_enrich_queue.py:201-204, 341-347, 502-510, 526-533, 606-613, 667-675` — Preserve queue deduplication, persistence, ordering, and error contracts. Consumer: test maintainers.\n- `tests/unit/test_ensures_boot_budget_